<</Title(JPAS and Jamsyar are the only two key players operating nationwide with comprehensive branch networks \(41 and 18 outlets\) and full cash/non-cash product suites.  Regional Competitor: Other Sharia guarantors consist of regional BUMD and provincial Sharia Units \(UUS\). Their reach is geographically locked to local provincial banks \(e.g., Bank NTB Syariah, Bank BJB Syariah\).  Additionally, POJK 10/2023 mandates regional UUS \(such as Jamkrida Jabar UUS with Rp5.62T volume\) to spin off into full standalone Sharia entities by 2028\2052031. This regulation creates potential new direct competitors or even portfolio acquisition targets.)/Dest[19 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2794 0 R/First 2838 0 R/Last 2839 0 R/Count -6>>
